═══ R19 EN 给了再问 (How do I start chanting?) — guard: clean ═══
Q: How do I start chanting?
Sources: Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) · types: introduction,xiaofangzi_guide,qa_metaphysics,qa_general
  ✓ names at least one sutra/mantra
  ✓ gives a count (N times / × N / N遍)
  ✓ AND asks the triage question in the same reply
  ✓ no generic 「I dedicate all merits」 closing
  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
Welcome! 🙏 A beautiful place to begin your journey.

Before I guide you further — have you chanted before, or is this completely new to you?

In the meantime, here's a simple starting point you can use right away:

---

📿 **Great Compassion Mantra** (大悲咒) — 3 times daily

Before reciting, say:
*"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me good health and peace of mind."*

📿 **Heart Sutra** (心经) — 3 times daily

Before reciting, say:
*"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me wisdom and remove my worries."*

⚠️ *Please avoid reciting the Heart Sutra after 10pm.*

---

To learn the pronunciation, follow along with this teaching video:
🔗 https://xinlingfamen.info/jingwen/

**Just 3 + 3 to start. Consistency matters more than quantity.** Once these feel natural, we can gradually add more. 🙏

---

So — have you chanted before, or is this your first time?

